    <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--pele-fg, #0f172a); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Cluster Trust Boundaries (4 Envelopes)
      </h3>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem;">
        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #3b82f6;">Trust Boundary 01</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.25rem;">ClusterControlPlane (CP)</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); margin-top: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.5;">
            High-trust isolation envelope hosting <code class="kube-code">kube-apiserver</code>, <code class="kube-code">kube-scheduler</code>, <code class="kube-code">kube-controller-manager</code>, and <code class="kube-code">cloud-controller-manager</code>. Protected by mTLS, dedicated CAs, and fine-grained RBAC.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #8b5cf6;">Trust Boundary 02</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.25rem;">ClusterControlPlaneData (CPD)</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); margin-top: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.5;">
            The datastore boundary protecting <code class="kube-code">etcd</code> and KMS envelope keys. Direct network access must be strictly forbidden except from authorized <code class="kube-code">kube-apiserver</code> endpoints using dedicated client certificates.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border-left: 4px solid #10b981;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #10b981;">Trust Boundary 03</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.25rem;">ClusterDataPlane (DP)</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); margin-top: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.5;">
            Worker nodes hosting <code class="kube-code">kubelet</code>, <code class="kube-code">kube-proxy</code>, container runtime engines (containerd/CRI-O), and untrusted customer pods. Pods must be constrained with Seccomp, AppArmor/SELinux, and non-root SecurityContexts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #f59e0b;">Trust Boundary 04</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.25rem;">External &amp; Supply Chain</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); margin-top: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.5;">
            OCI registries, CI/CD runners, cloud provider APIs (IAM, VPC, metadata service), and public internet actors. Enforce cryptographic image signing (Cosign), SLSA provenance, and IMDSv2 metadata protection.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

