            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">Rogue Multi-Tenant Actor</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              A valid tenant in a shared multi-tenant cluster attempting cross-namespace network sniffing, resource starvation (noisy neighbor), or cluster-wide CRD tampering.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('ta04', 'TA04', 'cluster')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
