              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; font-weight: 700;">TA05</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;">Registry Origin</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">Supply Chain Poisoner</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Injects backdoor malware into upstream container registries, base images, or CI/CD pipelines, evading boundary firewalls by piggybacking on valid image pulls.
            </p>
