              Infrastructure personnel or processes with hypervisor console access, unencrypted storage volume snapshots (EBS), or cloud VPC routing table authority.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('ta06', 'TA06', 'cluster')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🔍 Inspect in Sheet 1
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #e0e7ff; color: #3730a3; font-weight: 700;">TA07</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;">Physical / Hardware Origin</span>
