            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">Hardware &amp; Physical Adversary</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
