    <!-- Packet & Identity Flow Checkpoints (6 Stages) -->
    <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--pele-fg, #0f172a); margin: 0;">
            API Request &amp; Packet Flow Checkpoints (6 Stages)
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); margin: 0.25rem 0 0 0;">
            Deterministic execution path of every incoming request to the Kubernetes control plane before state persistence.
          </p>
        </div>
        <button onclick="applyPresetView('api-request-flow')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;">
          🌊 View Pipeline in Sheet 04
        </button>
      </div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem;">

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border-top: 3px solid #3b82f6;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6; text-transform: uppercase;">Stage 01</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.25rem 0;">Client Identity</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.775rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            OIDC tokens, X.509 client certificates, or projected ServiceAccount tokens.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border-top: 3px solid #3b82f6;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6; text-transform: uppercase;">Stage 02</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.25rem 0;">API TLS (6443)</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.775rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            mTLS termination with strict cipher suites, IP whitelisting, and load balancing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border-top: 3px solid #3b82f6;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6; text-transform: uppercase;">Stage 03</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.25rem 0;">Authentication (AuthN)</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.775rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            TokenReview, Webhook authenticator, or CA verification validating user/group claims.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border-top: 3px solid #3b82f6;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6; text-transform: uppercase;">Stage 04</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.25rem 0;">Authorization (AuthZ)</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.775rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            RBAC ClusterRoleBindings, NodeRestriction, and SubjectAccessReview webhooks.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border-top: 3px solid #3b82f6;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6; text-transform: uppercase;">Stage 05</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.25rem 0;">Admission Control</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.775rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            Mutating webhooks &rarr; Validating webhooks &rarr; Pod Security Admission (PSA).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border-top: 3px solid #8b5cf6;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: #8b5cf6; text-transform: uppercase;">Stage 06</div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0.25rem 0;">Storage &amp; Encryption</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.775rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            etcd v3 key-value persistence with KMS v2 envelope encryption of Secrets at rest.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- STRIDE Threat Modeling Taxonomy in Kubernetes -->
    <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--pele-fg, #0f172a); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        STRIDE Threat Modeling Taxonomy for Kubernetes
      </h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Every component in KubeDaily's architecture is categorized by its primary STRIDE threat vulnerability and mitigation envelope. Click any letter pill to filter the interactive canvas.
      </p>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
            <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #e2e8f0; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700;">S · Spoofing</span>
            <button onclick="setStrideFilter('S')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;">Filter Canvas</button>
          </div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;">Identity &amp; Authenticator Spoofing</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            Impersonating users, pods, nodes, or ServiceAccounts (anonymous access, ARP spoofing, client CA compromise).
          </p>
          <div style="font-size: 0.725rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Defense: OIDC, mTLS, NodeRestriction</div>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
            <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #e2e8f0; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700;">T · Tampering</span>
            <button onclick="setStrideFilter('T')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;">Filter Canvas</button>
          </div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;">State &amp; Data Tampering</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            Unauthorized mutation of cluster state, etcd records, container filesystems, or mutating webhook injection.
          </p>
          <div style="font-size: 0.725rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Defense: Read-only rootfs, Cosign image signing</div>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
            <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #e2e8f0; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700;">R · Repudiation</span>
            <button onclick="setStrideFilter('R')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;">Filter Canvas</button>
          </div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;">Audit Failure &amp; Repudiation</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            Executing administrative or cluster actions without non-repudiable audit logs, tamper-evident trails, or eBPF signals.
          </p>
          <div style="font-size: 0.725rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Defense: RequestResponse AuditPolicy, Falco</div>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
            <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #e2e8f0; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700;">I · Disclosure</span>
            <button onclick="setStrideFilter('I')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;">Filter Canvas</button>
          </div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;">Confidentiality &amp; Disclosure</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            Exposing secrets, API bearer tokens, cloud metadata (169.254.169.254), or unencrypted pod traffic in transit.
          </p>
          <div style="font-size: 0.725rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Defense: KMS v2 encryption, IMDSv2 hop=1</div>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
            <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #e2e8f0; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700;">D · DoS</span>
            <button onclick="setStrideFilter('D')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;">Filter Canvas</button>
          </div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;">Resource Starvation &amp; DoS</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            Exhausting API rate limits, etcd IOPS/disk space, worker node CPU/memory quotas, or iptables connection tables.
          </p>
          <div style="font-size: 0.725rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Defense: PriorityClass, Quotas, API Fairness</div>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.15rem; border-radius: 0.5rem;">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
            <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #e2e8f0; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 700;">E · Escalation</span>
            <button onclick="setStrideFilter('E')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;">Filter Canvas</button>
          </div>
          <h4 style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;">Privilege Escalation</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.4; margin: 0;">
            Escalating from unprivileged container process to host root OS, or from developer namespace Role to cluster-admin.
          </p>
          <div style="font-size: 0.725rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Defense: PSA Restricted, Seccomp, AppArmor</div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Production Hardening Controls & Detection Probes Matrix (C01–C17) -->
    <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--pele-fg, #0f172a); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Production Hardening Controls &amp; Detection Probes
      </h3>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C01</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">NetworkPolicy</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">Default-Deny Ingress &amp; Egress</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Enforces zero-trust isolation on the flat CNI network. Microservices communicate strictly over whitelisted ports and explicit label selectors.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c01', 'C01')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Policy YAML &amp; Shell
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C02</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">Pod Security</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">PSA Restricted Profile</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Enforces non-root execution, drops all Linux capabilities, and requires read-only root filesystems and RuntimeDefault seccomp profiles.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c02', 'C02')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Policy YAML &amp; Shell
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C03</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">KMS v2 Encryption</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">etcd Envelope Encryption</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Encrypts all Secret and ConfigMap resources at rest in etcd using external cloud KMS plugins (AWS KMS, Cloud KMS, Vault) with DEK caching.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c03', 'C03')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Policy YAML &amp; Shell
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C04</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">Admission Guardrails</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">Kyverno &amp; Admission Policies</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Enforces declarative governance policies across all namespaces, rejecting privileged containers and validating resource quotas in real time.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c04', 'C04')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Kyverno YAML
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C05</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">eBPF Detection</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">Falco &amp; Tetragon Probes</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Real-time kernel syscall tracing detecting reverse shells, namespace escapes (<code class="kube-code">sys_setns</code>), and IMDS credential access with automated Sigkill.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c05', 'C05')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Falco &amp; Tetragon Rules
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C10</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">Supply Chain</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">Cosign Cryptographic Signing</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Validates digital signatures and SLSA provenance attestations during image pull, preventing backdoored container images from ever running.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c10', 'C10')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Cosign CLI &amp; Policy
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C11</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">Cloud Metadata</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">IMDSv2 Hop Limit = 1</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Enforces session token authorization and limits IP TTL hop count so link-local metadata requests cannot traverse container bridge interfaces.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c11', 'C11')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Cloud Config
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C12</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">Audit Policy</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">RequestResponse Audit Logging</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Captures all administrative mutations, secret reads, and exec requests in tamper-evident audit logs streamed to external SIEM storage.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c12', 'C12')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Audit Policy YAML
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C16</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">Kernel Syscalls</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">Seccomp RuntimeDefault</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Blocks over 60 high-risk Linux system calls (<code class="kube-code">ptrace</code>, <code class="kube-code">bpf</code>, <code class="kube-code">mount</code>, <code class="kube-code">reboot</code>) inside all workload containers.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c16', 'C16')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect Seccomp Spec
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="kube-card" style="padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <span class="kube-badge" style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; font-weight: 700;">C17</span>
              <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;">MAC Confinement</span>
            </div>
            <h4 style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;">AppArmor &amp; SELinux Mandatory Access</h4>
            <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
              Enforces kernel Mandatory Access Control profiles that prevent container breakouts, socket hijacking, and unauthorized sensitive directory access.
            </p>
          </div>
          <button onclick="locateAndInspect('c17', 'C17')" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem; margin-top: 0.85rem; width: 100%;">
            🛡️ Inspect AppArmor Spec
          </button>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Multi-Engine Policy-as-Code Library (Kyverno · In-Tree CEL · OPA Gatekeeper) -->
    <div style="margin-top: 3.5rem;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        <div>
          <div class="kube-section-pill" style="background: #eff6ff; color: #2563eb; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;">Policy-as-Code Ecosystem · 3 Engines</div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--pele-fg, #0f172a); margin: 0.4rem 0 0.25rem 0;">
            Multi-Engine Policy-as-Code Library
          </h3>
          <p style="color: var(--pele-muted, #64748b); max-width: 820px; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            Select your enforcement standard: <strong style="color: #2563eb;">Kyverno</strong> (declarative YAML &amp; Sigstore Cosign verification), <strong style="color: #b45309;">In-Tree CEL</strong> (<code class="kube-code">ValidatingAdmissionPolicy</code> Kubernetes 1.30+ GA zero-latency in-apiserver evaluation), or <strong style="color: #7c3aed;">OPA Gatekeeper</strong> (Rego <code class="kube-code">ConstraintTemplate</code>). Toggle engines per card or inspect directly in the interactive slide-over drawer.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="https://kyverno.io/policies/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="kube-button kube-button-secondary" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;">
